[{"id":3897581558,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7oUF_2","user":{"login":"Alex2782","id":41921395,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxOTIxMzk1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41921395?u=74caa4e396a8e2995ac648a80f7488601d679e63&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782","html_url":"https://github.com/Alex2782","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"We should test this carefully (Editor + Templates):\n_I could check it more thoroughly on Android next week (or in two)._\n\n`BaseButton`\nInherited By: [Button](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/classes/class_button.html#class-button), [LinkButton](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/classes/class_linkbutton.html#class-linkbutton), [TextureButton](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/classes/class_texturebutton.html#class-texturebutton)\n\n`Button`\nInherited By: [CheckBox](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/classes/class_checkbox.html#class-checkbox), [CheckButton](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/classes/class_checkbutton.html#class-checkbutton), [ColorPickerButton](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/classes/class_colorpickerbutton.html#class-colorpickerbutton), [MenuButton](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/classes/class_menubutton.html#class-menubutton), [OptionButton](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/classes/class_optionbutton.html#class-optionbutton)\n\n----------\n\n### is_touchscreen_available\n\nGodot does not have a real check to see if a touch display is available.\nThis has led to regressions in the past (\"Gui/Tree\"). \n\n<details><summary>Details</summary>\n\nhttps://github.com/search?q=repo%3Agodotengine%2Fgodot%20is_touchscreen_available&type=code\n\nperhaps only `DisplayServerWeb` has it\n\n```js\n\tgodot_js_display_touchscreen_is_available: function () {\n\t\treturn 'ontouchstart' in window;\n\t}\n```\n\n\n`DisplayServerAndroid` and `DisplayServerAppleEmbedded` always return `true`(hardcoded)\n\n------\n\nOn all other platforms, `is_emulating_touch_from_mouse` is returned.\n\n```cpp\nbool DisplayServer::is_touchscreen_available() const {\n\treturn Input::get_singleton() && Input::get_singleton()->is_emulating_touch_from_mouse();\n}\n```\n\n</details>\n","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110893#pullrequestreview-3897581558","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110893","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110893#pullrequestreview-3897581558"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110893"}},"submitted_at":"2026-03-05T15:39:22Z","commit_id":"eb57b6b6ad336006777cdae8cbd2e38b14b35152"},{"id":3908672620,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7o-Zxs","user":{"login":"Nintorch","id":92302738,"node_id":"U_kgDOBYBtkg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92302738?u=f6c14ec512c7cd33f8d109f121e89b7e60e42f38&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch","html_url":"https://github.com/Nintorch","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Tested on my Android phone in the editor, it mostly works as expected, the only thing that didn't work but might be relevant is the button hover for multiple touches. Some other GUI nodes also don't work well for multiple touches, but I don't think that's really relevant for them (`OptionButton`, `ColorPickerButton`)\r\nThese nodes worked well for me: `Button`, `CheckBox`, `TextureButton`. I haven't tested `LinkButton` and `MenuButton`, but these oned probably also doesn't need multitouch support.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f14e9bb2-4087-4181-8985-baffc03d7f4a\r\n\r\nTest project: [Test.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/25814026/Test.zip)\r\nBut we still most likely have to wait for review from other teams.\r\n\r\nEDIT: As it turns out, hover only works if mouse is emulated from touch, that's why it doesn't work for multiple touches.","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110893#pullrequestreview-3908672620","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110893","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110893#pullrequestreview-3908672620"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110893"}},"submitted_at":"2026-03-07T12:26:08Z","commit_id":"eb57b6b6ad336006777cdae8cbd2e38b14b35152"},{"id":3930596254,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7qSCOe","user":{"login":"Alex2782","id":41921395,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxOTIxMzk1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41921395?u=74caa4e396a8e2995ac648a80f7488601d679e63&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782","html_url":"https://github.com/Alex2782","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"`Enable touch input in Editor. ` https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110893/changes/e267e5488e11e1b1369e9bf7413b61ff4e3ada74\r\n\r\nI tested the last commit on an Android Samsung tablet and didn't notice any regressions (as long as touch input was used), and there were hardly any functions/buttons that could benefit from multitouch.\r\n\r\nThis time I connected a Bluetooth mouse to my tablet and tested the mouse input. The buttons do not react to mouse clicks, neither in the editor nor in the game window (export template).\r\n\r\n@Kazox61 It is possible to force this behavior (tested macOS Godot Editor) if you have no testing options with a BT mouse + Android.\r\n\r\n```cpp\r\n\tbool touchscreen_available = true; //DisplayServer::get_singleton()->is_touchscreen_available();\r\n\tif (touchscreen_available) {\r\n```\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","state":"CHANGES_REQUESTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110893#pullrequestreview-3930596254","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110893","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110893#pullrequestreview-3930596254"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110893"}},"submitted_at":"2026-03-11T15:43:01Z","commit_id":null},{"id":3992287285,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7t9Xg1","user":{"login":"Alex2782","id":41921395,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxOTIxMzk1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41921395?u=74caa4e396a8e2995ac648a80f7488601d679e63&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782","html_url":"https://github.com/Alex2782","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"I tested it on Android and didn't find any critical regressions. We can still optimize some minor things in the code.","state":"CHANGES_REQUESTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110893#pullrequestreview-3992287285","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110893","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110893#pullrequestreview-3992287285"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110893"}},"submitted_at":"2026-03-23T16:35:14Z","commit_id":null},{"id":4019559164,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7vlZr8","user":{"login":"Kazox61","id":93524528,"node_id":"U_kgDOBZMSMA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.co